# Apps Script submission-portal source. Kept out of the repo because it holds
# FOLDER_ID — the Drive folder that receives every student submission.
# NOTE: FORM_KEY in that file is NOT a secret. It is printed into the published
# HTML of the submission page and anyone can read it with View Source; it is
# rotatable friction, not authentication. The real controls (email domain,
# student-ID format, PDF signature, size caps, rate limits) run server-side.
# Real values live in the Apps Script editor and in a local working copy only.
Code.gs
*.gs

# Isolated feature worktrees
.worktrees/
